# Civil War Strategy: files that are missing or wrong. The run starts without MTN.VGA, with a
# CWS.CFG that names no player count and no display speed, and with a map that has two one-way
# roads (tests/data/bad-map: Chattanooga to Baltimore, which has room for the road back, and
# Baton Rouge to Chattanooga, which has none).
#! seed 1861
#! cfg player=0 turbo=0
#! without graphics/MTN.VGA
#! data bad-map

# The title menu, after "ERROR: Missing File 'MTN.VGA'": Start NEW Game.
play until 2:V
digest
text s
play until 2:M
digest

# UTILITY, Chk Links: the report of the map's roads, and a key.
text u
prompt
text c
play until 1:L
digest
key space
play until 2:M
digest

# Files, Quit to DOS, Yes, and a key for END's "Press any key to continue".
text f
prompt
text q
prompt
text y
repeat space
